    {
      "id": "2026-10-13-editor-width-padding-variants",
      "kind": "fix",
      "summary": "Size the side padding of the `default`, `demo` and `fullWidth` variants to the editor's own width instead of the viewport. Padding shrinks to 24 px in a narrow editor, so a 180 px editor gets a 132 px text column instead of 52 px. Editors at least 512 px wide, or 640 px for `fullWidth`, keep their current padding.",
